# 301 bridge: old brand domain (+www) to the new domain, path-preserving.
# uno-no-mercy.com stays attached to this Pages project for the bridge
# period (decision: 12 months, revisit 2027-08) so these host-matched
# rules keep firing.
https://uno-no-mercy.com/* https://open-mercy.com/:splat 301
https://www.uno-no-mercy.com/* https://open-mercy.com/:splat 301

# Redirect pages.dev domains to the custom domain
https://uno-no-mercy.pages.dev/* https://open-mercy.com/:splat 301
https://*.uno-no-mercy.pages.dev/* https://open-mercy.com/:splat 301

# Redirect www to apex
https://www.open-mercy.com/* https://open-mercy.com/:splat 301

# NOTE: no `/* /index.html 200` rule — Cloudflare Pages flags it as an
# infinite loop and ignores it. Deep links (/leaderboard, /p/<code>) are
# served by Pages' automatic SPA fallback (no 404.html in the build output),
# verified via `wrangler pages dev`.
